/// <summary>Writes {"Value": si, "Unit": "J/kg"}. Reads that (any unit of SpecificEnergy, by exact symbol) or a bare SI number - a unit of another quantity is rejected.</summary>
public sealed class SpecificEnergyJsonConverter : JsonConverter<SpecificEnergy>
{
    public override SpecificEnergy Read(ref Utf8JsonReader reader, Type typeToConvert, JsonSerializerOptions options)
        => SpecificEnergy.FromSI(QuantityJson.Read(ref reader, "SpecificEnergy", SpecificEnergyUnit.BySymbol));

    public override void Write(Utf8JsonWriter writer, SpecificEnergy value, JsonSerializerOptions options)
        => QuantityJson.Write(writer, value.SI, SpecificEnergyUnit.SI.Symbol);
}

public static partial class UnitMath
{
    [return: DimensionOf(nameof(value), PowerParameter = nameof(toPower))]
    public static UnknownUnit Pow(this SpecificEnergy value, int toPower) => new(Math.Pow(value.SI, toPower));

    [return: DimensionOf(nameof(value), Root = 2)]
    public static UnknownUnit Sqrt(this SpecificEnergy value) => new(Math.Sqrt(value.SI));

    public static SpecificEnergy Sum(this IEnumerable<SpecificEnergy> values)
    {
        double sum = 0;
        foreach (var v in values) sum += v.SI;
        return SpecificEnergy.FromSI(sum);
    }

    public static SpecificEnergy Average(this IEnumerable<SpecificEnergy> values)
    {
        double sum = 0; long count = 0;
        foreach (var v in values) { sum += v.SI; count++; }
        return count == 0 ? throw new InvalidOperationException("Sequence contains no elements") : SpecificEnergy.FromSI(sum / count);
    }

    public static SpecificEnergy Min(this IEnumerable<SpecificEnergy> values) => Aggregate(values, Math.Min);
    public static SpecificEnergy Max(this IEnumerable<SpecificEnergy> values) => Aggregate(values, Math.Max);

    private static SpecificEnergy Aggregate(IEnumerable<SpecificEnergy> values, Func<double, double, double> pick)
    {
        using var e = values.GetEnumerator();
        if (!e.MoveNext()) throw new InvalidOperationException("Sequence contains no elements");
        var result = e.Current.SI;
        while (e.MoveNext()) result = pick(result, e.Current.SI);
        return SpecificEnergy.FromSI(result);
    }
}
